|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---|
| NATIVE | de | 0.95 | 3.17 | 4.21 | yes |
| NATIVE | th | 1.15 | 3.86 | 5.12 | yes |
| NATIVE | sw | 1.09 | 3.66 | 4.85 | no |
| TRANSLATE-ACT | de | 0.42 | 1.40 | 1.86 | yes |
| TRANSLATE-ACT | th | 0.62 | 2.06 | 2.74 | yes |
| TRANSLATE-ACT | sw | 0.84 | 2.82 | 3.74 | yes |

**Harness:** `announced` threads through `condition_seed`/`record_id`/shard path/record/`verify_ledger`, joining the payload *only* when it differs from the cap — E1 and coupled cells stay byte-identical, and the two blocks share their common cell. `EXPERIMENTS.md` corrected at the "Why it matters" paragraph only.

